      "text": "Your reviewer suggests changes"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Sam opens the same link. The switch in the top bar says Suggesting and stays there: whatever he types is shown as a proposal, underlined in his colour, and whatever he deletes is struck through. The text itself does not change.",
