      "path": "/d/2m4SrSUKQQ",
      "actor": "sam"
    },
    {
      "kind": "outcome",
      "file": "06.webp",
      "caption": "Sam suggests deleting a sentence: it is struck through until you decide",
      "cursor": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 307
      },
      "path": "/d/2m4SrSUKQQ",
      "actor": "sam"
    },
    {
      "kind": "chapter",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Accept or reject"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "On your screen the suggestions appear as Sam types. Open the Suggestions panel: each suggestion has a card with who proposed it, when, and buttons to accept or reject. On a phone, tap a suggestion in the text to open its card.",
